      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "harness self-tests → fixture immutability + completeness vs the committed baseline → full --offline replay run.\nRun it before landing ANY edit to skills/*/SKILL.md, config/icp.md, config/signal.yaml or config/sequences.yaml. Exit 1 blocks the edit until reconciled.",
