      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "fixture.yaml — one frozen decision: gold = the\nPOST-CORRECTION outcome (after human review,\nafter the Sales Nav pass, after the incident\nwriteup), plus `forbidden` traps naming the\nspecific wrong answer that actually happened.\ninputs/ — excerpted raw captures (≤50KB/file),\nno secrets, no gold leakage.",
      "originalText": "fixture.yaml — one frozen decision: gold = the POST-CORRECTION outcome (after human review, after the Sales Nav pass, after the incident writeup), plus `forbidden` traps naming the specific wrong answer that actually happened.\ninputs/ — excerpted raw captures (≤50KB/file), no secrets, no gold leakage.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
