      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "LIVE: shells out to `claude -p --output-format\njson --model <EVAL_MODEL>` — works on any\nhost, no API key in the repo. Records a replay\nfor every call.\n\nOFFLINE: replays/<task>/<id>.json, committed\nand keyed to the fixture sha — deterministic,\n$0, and the corpus check-evals.sh runs. A\nstale replay is a skip, and skips are reported\nloudly.",
      "originalText": "LIVE: shells out to `claude -p --output-format json --model <EVAL_MODEL>` — works on any host, no API key in the repo. Records a replay for every call.\n\nOFFLINE: replays/<task>/<id>.json, committed and keyed to the fixture sha — deterministic, $0, and the corpus check-evals.sh runs. A stale replay is a skip, and skips are reported loudly.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
