      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Follows the stated protocol: the object the\nreply ENDS with is the verdict, and it must\ncarry the primary field as a string.\n\nNo fallback to an earlier object — the\nretracted one is frequently the forbidden\nvalue, which would report a paid-for lesson as\nregressed on a reply that answered correctly.\n\nParse failure = WRONG (scored 0, raw response\nin details) — never a skip.",
      "originalText": "Follows the stated protocol: the object the reply ENDS with is the verdict, and it must carry the primary field as a string.\n\nNo fallback to an earlier object — the retracted one is frequently the forbidden value, which would report a paid-for lesson as regressed on a reply that answered correctly.\n\nParse failure = WRONG (scored 0, raw response in details) — never a skip.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
