      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "The unfair advantage: capture-first means\nevery historical decision's complete input is\nalready frozen in raw/, and the corrected\noutcome is recorded in account.yaml +\nprogress.md + the registry. Fixtures are\nASSEMBLED, not invented.",
      "originalText": "The unfair advantage: capture-first means every historical decision's complete input is already frozen in raw/, and the corrected outcome is recorded in account.yaml + progress.md + the registry. Fixtures are ASSEMBLED, not invented.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
